# Meeva

Read `AGENTS.md` before changing this app.

This folder is **drizz.dev** (portfolio at `/`) plus the Meeva software-company headquarters (`/meeva`) and the base template to duplicate for freelance projects.

Products are named `{Product} by meeva` (example: lockIn by meeva in sibling `proactive/`).

Pages stay thin. Portfolio copy lives in `config/portfolio.ts`. Meeva brand copy lives in `config/site.ts`. Theme tokens live in `themes/portfolio.css` and `themes/hq.css`.

Do not reintroduce Ashlove healthcare UI. Do not merge the lockIn app into this repo.
